{"n":24,"title":"Small talk & first stories","blurb":"Финальное повторение — small talk и первая история","steps":[{"stage":"Warm-up","type":"note","title":"Small talk & first stories","sub":"","html":"<p>Весь курс в одной поездке: познакомиться, поболтать и рассказать первую историю.</p><ul class=\"cp-aims\"><li>Познакомиться и поддержать разговор</li><li>Использовать всё из юнитов 1–7</li><li>Познакомиться с прошедшим — только на слух</li></ul>"},{"stage":"Warm-up","type":"pick","title":"Что вы уже умеете сказать по-английски?","sub":"Здесь нет неправильного ответа.","options":[{"label":"my name"},{"label":"where I'm from"},{"label":"my job"},{"label":"my family"},{"label":"the time"},{"label":"what I like"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"choice","title":"Повторение: выберите ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"— Hello. What's your name?","options":["I'm from Turkey.","I'm Timur. Nice to meet you.","Yes, I am."],"answer":"I'm Timur. Nice to meet you.","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"choice","title":"Повторение: выберите ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"— Where are you from?","options":["I'm from Kazakhstan.","I'm twenty-five.","I'm a teacher."],"answer":"I'm from Kazakhstan.","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"choice","title":"Повторение: выберите ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"— What do you do?","options":["I'm fine, thanks.","At nine o'clock.","I'm an engineer."],"answer":"I'm an engineer.","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"gap","title":"Повторение: дополните разговор.","sub":"","before":"— How are you? —","after":", thanks. And you?","answers":["Fine"],"bank":["Fine","Yes","Please"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"gap","title":"Повторение: дополните разговор.","sub":"","before":"This is my colleague.","after":"name is Aigul.","answers":["Her"],"bank":["His","Her","Their"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"gap","title":"Повторение: дополните разговор.","sub":"","before":"— How old are you? — I'm","after":".","answers":["twenty-five"],"bank":["twenty-five","at twenty-five","twenty-five years"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Повторение: выберите правильное предложение.","sub":"","prompt":"Юнит 3 · there is / there are","options":["There is two bedrooms.","There are two bedrooms.","There have two bedrooms."],"answer":"There are two bedrooms.","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Повторение: выберите правильное предложение.","sub":"","prompt":"Юнит 3 · have got","options":["She have got a laptop.","She has got a laptop.","She has a got laptop."],"answer":"She has got a laptop.","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Повторение: выберите правильное предложение.","sub":"","prompt":"Юнит 4 · Present Simple","options":["He get up at seven.","He gets up at seven.","He getting up at seven."],"answer":"He gets up at seven.","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"cols","title":"Повторение: at, on или in?","sub":"","columns":["at","on / in"],"items":[{"text":"Monday","col":1},{"text":"the morning","col":1},{"text":"seven o'clock","col":0},{"text":"July","col":1},{"text":"half past two","col":0},{"text":"night","col":0}]},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Повторение: дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"I","after":"drive. I go by bus.","answers":["don't"],"bank":["doesn't","don't","not"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Повторение: дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"","after":"often do you cook?","answers":["How"],"bank":["Who","How","What"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Повторение: дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"I can","after":", but not very well.","answers":["swim"],"bank":["swim","to swim","swimming"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"ch