answer":"Where were you born?","why":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"Где это можно услышать?","src":"/course/a0/audio/cecbd486edd5.mp3","options":["in a café","at a station or an airport","in a shop"],"answer":"at a station or an airport","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"gap","title":"Послушайте. Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"The announcement gives a","after":".","answers":["time"],"bank":["time","price","name"],"src":"/course/a0/audio/cecbd486edd5.mp3"},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"— What's the weather like with you?","src":"/course/a0/audio/6d634e8b8425.mp3","options":["It's cloudy but warm.","It's snowy.","I'm fine, thanks."],"answer":"It's cloudy but warm.","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"Какая зима в Нью-Йорке?","src":"/course/a0/audio/b91cb447246a.mp3","options":["warm","very cold and often snowy","rainy"],"answer":"very cold and often snowy","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"Зачем человек путешествует?","src":null,"options":["on business","on holiday","to study"],"answer":"on holiday","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"gap","title":"Послушайте. Дополните ответ.","sub":"","before":"— Where are you from? — I'm","after":"Kazakhstan.","answers":["from"],"bank":["from","in","at"],"src":null},{"stage":"Listening","type":"phrases","title":"Первый взгляд на прошедшее время.","sub":"Пока не нужно их использовать — просто заметьте.","items":[{"text":"Today I get up late. Yesterday I got up late.","src":null},{"text":"Today I have a good day. Yesterday I had a bad day.","src":null}]},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"Когда был ужасный день?","src":"/course/a0/audio/6c3b0456352e.mp3","options":["today","yesterday","last week"],"answer":"yesterday","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"Начальник был доволен?","src":"/course/a0/audio/6c3b0456352e.mp3","options":["Yes, he was.","No, he wasn't."],"answer":"No, he wasn't.","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"note","title":"Прочитайте про поездку Тимура.","sub":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Timur</p><p>Hi! I'm Timur. I'm at the airport in Almaty.</p><p>I'm going to London. My flight is at seven thirty.</p><p>I'm a little tired, but I'm happy. It's my first trip.</p><p>Yesterday I was at work. Today I'm a traveller!</p>"},{"stage":"Listening","type":"choice","title":"True или False?","sub":"","prompt":"Timur is at the airport.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"True","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Timur</p><p>Hi! I'm Timur. I'm at the airport in Almaty.</p><p>I'm going to London. My flight is at seven thirty.</p><p>I'm a little tired, but I'm happy. It's my first trip.</p><p>Yesterday I was at work. Today I'm a traveller!</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Listening","type":"choice","title":"True или False?","sub":"","prompt":"His flight is at nine o'clock.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"False","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Timur</p><p>Hi! I'm Timur. I'm at the airport in Almaty.</p><p>I'm going to London. My flight is at seven thirty.</p><p>I'm a little tired, but I'm happy. It's my first trip.</p><p>Yesterday I was at work. Today I'm a traveller!</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Listening","type":"choice","title":"Прочитайте ещё раз. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"Где Тимур был вчера?","options":["At the airport","At work","In London"],"answer":"At work","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Timur</p><p>Hi! I'm Timur. I'm at the airport in Almaty.</p><p>I'm going to London. My flight is at seven thirty.</p><p>I'm a little tired, but I'm happy. It's my first trip.</p><p>Yesterday I was at work. Today I'm a traveller!</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Speaking","type":"write","title":"Напишите свой small talk.","sub":"Пять строк: приветствие, имя, страна, работа и вопрос в ответ.","placeholder":"","html":"<ul class=\"cp-frames\"><li>Hello. I'm ___ .</li><li>I'm from ___ .</li><li>I'm ___ .</li><li>And you? ___ ?</li></ul><div class=\"cp-note__chips\"><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">Hello</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">Nice to meet you</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">I'm from</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">I'm a</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">Where are you from?</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">What do you do?</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">Are you here on holiday?</span></div>","modelHtml":"<ul class=\"cp-checks\"><li>Сначала я поздоровался(ась).</li><li>Страну я назвал(а) с <b>from</b>.</li><li>Я задал(а) встречный вопрос.</li></ul>"},{"stage":"Speaking","type":"record","title":"Произнесите свой small talk. Запишите и послушайте.","sub":"Это весь курс в четырёх строках.","items":["Hello. I'm Timur. Nice to meet you.","I'm from Kazakhstan. I'm an engineer.","Where are you from?","It was great to meet you. See you later!"]},{"stage":"Wrap","type":"checklist","title":"Курс A0 пройден","sub":"24 урока из 24 · вы готовы к A1","items":["Я могу познакомиться и поддержать разговор.","Я могу рассказать о своей жизни, дне и вещах.","Я могу говорить о прошлом с was и were."]}]}
